        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises H-185 Modern Hexagonal Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very modern hexagon floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or high end commercial applications.  1\" height adds to its modern look. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the door knob or lever as well.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b>Larger  <a href=\"/products/modern-2-inch-hexagonal-floor-mount-door-stop-fei-h-195\">2 Inch Modern Hexagonal Door Stop</a></b> for undercut doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises H-185 Modern Hexagonal Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Ring: Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #12 x 1-1/2\" screw</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
