                "title": "Modern 1 Inch Hexagonal Floor Mount Door Stop, FEI-H-185",
                "description": "Field Enterprises H-185 Modern 1 Inch Hexagonal Floor Mount Door Stops. This very modern floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or high end commercial applications.  1 inch height adds to its modern look.  Available in Polished Brass, Antique Brass, Satin Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Polished Chrome, and Polished Nickel.",
